      .env loaded (.env); set here: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN, OPENAI_API_KEY, CRR_MODEL
      values are never printed, and an already-set variable always wins

── WHAT THIS RUN WILL DO - read it, then decide ────────────────────────────────────────────────

      mode            LIVE - THIS SPENDS REAL MONEY
      adapter         anthropic (Messages API)
      model           claude-opus-5   $5/Mtok in, $25/Mtok out
      effort          high

      goal            Look up member 10043 in the riverbend core banking back office, report their name, share balance and membership status, and open their member record.
      member          10043, synthetic, and deliberately NOT the member `pnpm demo` uses
      tenant          riverbend / riverbend-corebank-live
      target          http://127.0.0.1:63466   (alias "corebank", loopback fixture)
      entry           /search

      ALLOWLIST - this is everything the model may do while it drives
        corebank/search                              WRITE_REVERSIBLE
        corebank/search/results                      WRITE_REVERSIBLE
        corebank/member/:memberId                    WRITE_REVERSIBLE
        action kinds            click, type, select, setChecked, pressKey, focus, navigate
        discoveryMaxEffect      WRITE_REVERSIBLE   <- no irreversible action can be dispatched
        approval token          none (the loop is given approval: null)

      BUDGET - enforced between turns from the usage the provider returns
        max spend, whole run    $2.00   (20% of the $10 project cap)
        max_tokens per turn     2,000   (adapter default is 16,000; lowered - see DISCOVER_MAX_OUTPUT_TOKENS)
        max turns               24
        max billed tokens       750,000   price-independent backstop
        one turn's ceiling      ~$0.06 at max_tokens with a 2,000-token prompt

      THE GUARD IS A CEILING, NOT A TARGET. Before every turn the runner projects that
      turn's worst case - the whole prompt at full input rate, the output at max_tokens -
      and stops the run cleanly if it would cross the cap. Nothing is thrown away when it
      does: the transcript, the journal and the recorded steps are all written down.

      destination     evidence/discovery-live
      credential      ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN, OPENAI_API_KEY, CRR_MODEL loaded from .env


