        review   prose-needs-author  output "memberName" is free text, and no deterministic rule can tell a balance from a member's name; a person must confirm its sensitivity and agentDisclosure before this contract is published
        review   prose-needs-author  output "membershipStatus" is free text, and no deterministic rule can tell a balance from a member's name; a person must confirm its sensitivity and agentDisclosure before this contract is published
        review   outcome-code-carries-recorded-value  the proposed outcome code MEMBER_FOUND_ACTIVE spells a value this run recorded as the output "membershipStatus"; a symbolic code is kept rather than withheld, so a person must confirm the wording is the application's vocabulary and not this member's data
        review   prose-withheld  the model's title for the proposed outcome MEMBER_FOUND_ACTIVE quoted a value recorded as the output "membershipStatus"; it is withheld rather than rewritten, because free-form prose about observed data cannot be reliably redacted
        review   prose-withheld  the model's why for the proposed outcome MEMBER_FOUND_ACTIVE quoted a value recorded as the output "memberName", "shareBalance", "membershipStatus"; it is withheld rather than rewritten, because free-form prose about observed data cannot be reliably redacted
        review   outcome-candidate-needs-detector  the model proposed 1 business outcome(s); no detector was written for any of them, because a detector for a screen the run never observed is exactly how a false MEMBER_NOT_FOUND is emitted

